        "event": "Winter Weather Advisory",
        "headline": "Winter Weather Advisory issued July 26 at 2:34PM AKDT until July 27 at 4:00AM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...Mixed precipitation. Total snow accumulations between 2 and\n6 inches and ice accumulations around a light glaze.\n\n* WHERE...Central Brooks Range.\n\n* WHEN...Until 4 AM AKDT Monday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Travel may be impacted.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Widespread 2 inches of snow accumulation is\nexpected in total with up to 6 inches possible at higher\nelevations. Snow diminishes this evening with periods of freezing\ndrizzle being possible overnight.",
        "severity": "Moderate",
        "certainty": "Likely",
        "urgency": "Expected",
        "sender": "NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "effective": "2026-07-26T14:34:00-08:00",
        "expires": "2026-07-27T04:00:00-08:00",
        "areas": "Central Brooks Range",
        "category": "Met",
        "response": "Execute",
        "instruction": "Slow down and use caution while traveling. Visit 511.alaska.gov or\ncall 5 1 1 for the latest road conditions.",
        "lat": null,
